### ============================================
### Contact Management API Tests
### Test full CRUD operations for contacts
### ============================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@acme_subdomain = acme
@techstart_subdomain = techstart

### ============================================
### Setup: Login to get access token
### ============================================

### 1. Login as John (Sales) in Acme
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

{
  "email": "john.sales@tawasol.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

# @name loginAcme
### Expected: 200 OK with access token

### 2. Login as John in TechStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{techstart_subdomain}}

{
  "email": "john.sales@techstart.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

# @name loginTechStart
### Expected: 200 OK with access token

### ============================================
### Contact CRUD Operations - Acme Tenant
### ============================================

### 3. Create a new contact (no company)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "email": "alice.johnson@example.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-1234",
  "mobile": "+1-555-5678",
  "position": "Software Engineer",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "city": "San Francisco",
  "state": "CA",
  "country": "USA",
  "tags": ["developer", "frontend"]
}

# @name createContact1
### Expected: 201 Created with contact details

### 4. Create a contact with company (use existing company ID from seed)
# First, you'll need a company ID - you can get one from the seed data or create a company
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

{
  "firstName": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "bob.smith@acmecorp.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-9999",
  "position": "CTO",
  "notes": "Key decision maker",
  "tags": ["decision-maker", "technical"]
}

# @name createContact2
### Expected: 201 Created

### 5. Get all contacts (no filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with array of contacts + pagination

### 6. Get contacts with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with paginated results

### 7. Search contacts by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts?search=Alice HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with matching contacts

### 8. Filter contacts by tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts?tags=developer,frontend HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with filtered contacts

### 9. Sort contacts by creation date (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts?sortBy=createdAt&sortOrder=desc HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with sorted contacts

### 10. Get a specific contact by ID
# Replace with actual ID from createContact1 response
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{createContact1.response.body.data.id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with full contact details including related data

### 11. Update contact
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{createContact1.response.body.data.id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

{
  "position": "Senior Software Engineer",
  "department": "Engineering - Frontend",
  "notes": "Promoted to senior position",
  "tags": ["developer", "frontend", "senior"]
}

### Expected: 200 OK with updated contact

### 12. Get contact statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/stats HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with contact statistics (total, by owner, etc.)

### ============================================
### Tenant Isolation Tests
### ============================================

### 13. Try to access Acme contact from TechStart tenant (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{createContact1.response.body.data.id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTechStart.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{techstart_subdomain}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found (contact doesn't exist in TechStart)

### 14. Create contact in TechStart tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTechStart.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{techstart_subdomain}}

{
  "firstName": "Charlie",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "charlie@techstart.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-7777",
  "position": "Product Manager",
  "tags": ["product", "management"]
}

# @name createContactTechStart
### Expected: 201 Created (different tenant)

### 15. Verify TechStart has different contacts
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginTechStart.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{techstart_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK with only TechStart contacts (not Acme contacts)

### ============================================
### Validation & Error Tests
### ============================================

### 16. Try to create contact without required fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

{
  "email": "incomplete@example.com"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request (missing firstName, lastName)

### 17. Try to create duplicate email in same tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Duplicate",
  "email": "alice.johnson@example.com"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request (email already exists)

### 18. Try to access contact without authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized

### 19. Try to create contact without tenant header
POST {{baseUrl}}/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized (tenant required)

### ============================================
### Cleanup: Delete Contacts
### ============================================

### 20. Delete the test contact
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{createContact1.response.body.data.id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 200 OK (contact deleted)

### 21. Verify contact is deleted
GET {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{createContact1.response.body.data.id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 404 Not Found

### 22. Try to delete contact from wrong tenant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contacts/{{createContactTechStart.response.body.data.id}} HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAcme.response.body.data.accessToken}}
X-Tenant-Subdomain: {{acme_subdomain}}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request or 404 Not Found (tenant isolation)

### ============================================
### Summary:
### ✓ Full CRUD operations
### ✓ Pagination and filtering
### ✓ Search functionality
### ✓ Tenant isolation enforced
### ✓ Validation working
### ✓ Statistics endpoint
### ============================================
